The adaptation uses Mona's semantic styles, labels and model-selection callback.
The Python model metadata normalization in mona/providers/reasoning.py follows
Cindy packages/model-providers/src/modelDiscovery.ts, with Mona field names and
additional DeepSeek / Anthropic capability response support.
The managed model baseline uses selected explicit entries from Cindy
packages/model-providers/catalog/provider-models.json, scoped to Mona's
reviewed managed model IDs; other provider routes do not inherit these entries.
